  "Free JEV calls, when available, use the operator’s key. You can connect your own TypeSafe or OpenRouter key instead; provider charges then apply. Both options go through Forma’s backend to the official provider. Exported sites never receive a key.": "Free JEV calls, when available, use the operator’s key. You can connect your own TypeSafe or OpenRouter key instead; provider charges then apply. Both options go through Forma’s backend to the official provider. Exported sites never receive a key.",
