  "Do I need to install anything?": "Do I need to install anything?",
  "No installation is needed for this hosted editor. Use the same browser profile to reopen projects, and download JSON backups for safekeeping.": "No installation is needed for this hosted editor. Use the same browser profile to reopen projects, and download JSON backups for safekeeping.",
  "Projects and uploaded images are saved in this browser profile, where anyone using the profile can open them. There is no cloud backup. Free JEV builds use the operator’s key. If you connect a personal key, it stays in this tab’s memory and passes through Forma’s backend only for your connection tests and live builds. Reload or disconnect to remove your key.": "Projects and uploaded images are saved in this browser profile, where anyone using the profile can open them. There is no cloud backup. Free JEV builds use the operator’s key. If you connect a personal key, it stays in this tab’s memory and passes through Forma’s backend only for your connection tests and live builds. Reload or disconnect to remove your key.",
  "Forma uses necessary cookies for the anonymous session and to verify requests, with no tracking or advertising cookies. Browser storage keeps your projects and preferences. Free JEV calls use the operator’s key and are limited per public IP address. A personal key stays in this tab’s memory and passes through Forma’s backend only for your connection tests and live builds. Reload or disconnect to remove your key.": "Forma uses necessary cookies for the anonymous session and to verify requests, with no tracking or advertising cookies. Browser storage keeps your projects and preferences. Free JEV calls use the operator’s key and are limited per public IP address. A personal key stays in this tab’s memory and passes through Forma’s backend only for your connection tests and live builds. Reload or disconnect to remove your key.",
  "Disconnected. The API key was removed from this tab.": "Disconnected. The API key was removed from this tab.",
  "A design normally uses 2 provider calls. Free access allows 10 calls per public IP address each UTC day, when available. Testing your own key uses one billable call; builds using it are billed to you. Offline demo makes no provider calls.": "A design normally uses 2 provider calls. Free access allows 10 calls per public IP address each UTC day, when available. Testing your own key uses one billable call; builds using it are billed to you. Offline demo makes no provider calls.",
  "Yes. Free JEV access, when available, includes 10 provider calls per public IP address each UTC day, usually 5 designs. After that, connect your own API key. Offline demo uses local keyword rules and makes no provider calls.": "Yes. Free JEV access, when available, includes 10 provider calls per public IP address each UTC day, usually 5 designs. After that, connect your own API key. Offline demo uses local keyword rules and makes no provider calls.",
  "Free JEV builds use the operator’s daily allowance when available. If you connect your own TypeSafe or OpenRouter key, tests and builds use your provider account and may be billed to you. A key test uses one call and a design normally uses two. Offline demo makes none.": "Free JEV builds use the operator’s daily allowance when available. If you connect your own TypeSafe or OpenRouter key, tests and builds use your provider account and may be billed to you. A key test uses one call and a design normally uses two. Offline demo makes none.",
